{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Descend the dangerous depths of Mindaro, a 1-6 player co-op action-horror game. Navigate caves, biomes, and industrial ruins while scavenging for survival and uncovering hidden secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u201cYou are not the first to be sent and may not be the last.\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/9724d7ee20d7d27634d216a1e5a02d6c.avif?t=1752693812\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>I WANT YOU TO JOIN THIS EXPEDITION!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Descend</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find out what's on the bottom of this abyss, descending through layers as deep as your courage will allow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/f4f7a3212948d164e42fa8941822f264.poster.avif?t=1752693812\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/f4f7a3212948d164e42fa8941822f264.webm?t=1752693812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/f4f7a3212948d164e42fa8941822f264.mp4?t=1752693812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Survive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don't be fooled by how everything looks; it has survived this long for a reason, and it's waiting for you to come down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/750ac2332df6dd9227da6ff4294dc100.poster.avif?t=1752693812\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/750ac2332df6dd9227da6ff4294dc100.webm?t=1752693812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/750ac2332df6dd9227da6ff4294dc100.mp4?t=1752693812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Remember to explore, learn everything you can to help future Pioneers with the knowledge to conquer the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/fa2bdd62d2f0859c041f57929215d244.poster.avif?t=1752693812\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/fa2bdd62d2f0859c041f57929215d244.webm?t=1752693812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/fa2bdd62d2f0859c041f57929215d244.mp4?t=1752693812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Scavenge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use everything you can find to your disposal, and remember to secure the classified documents to be sent back to base \u2013 the fate of the mission depends on it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/ed88294044ae53923cb49486ae488fda.poster.avif?t=1752693812\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/ed88294044ae53923cb49486ae488fda.webm?t=1752693812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/ed88294044ae53923cb49486ae488fda.mp4?t=1752693812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3879330?t=1752693812","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/42731e048cf2a7e5eb8f0af4bab1d7f12b298443/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752693812","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/7c7f730051ebf19bca60918aad9a776521a1c785/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752693812","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/7c7f730051ebf19bca60918aad9a776521a1c785/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752693812","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>In Development</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We are <strong>Burning Boats Studios</strong>, an independent game development team based in Mexico. We're thrilled to announce <strong>Mindaro</strong>, our ambitious project currently in active development. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/aa52b55144891d9765657f8beb573713.avif?t=1752693812\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a small, dedicated team, our passion is to craft an engaging and polished gaming experience that resonates with a wide audience. We believe in creating games that are not only fun to play but also contribute positively to the gaming community we're proud to be a part of.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Your</strong> <strong>feedback</strong> is invaluable to us. We openly welcome any questions, suggestions, or constructive criticism as we continue to refine Mindaro. Thank you for following our progress; your support means the world. If you haven't already, please consider adding Mindaro to your <strong>wishlist</strong> \u2013 it truly helps us on our journey to launch a game we believe everyone will enjoy.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Descend the dangerous depths of Mindaro, a 1-6 player co-op action-horror game. Navigate caves, biomes, and industrial ruins while scavenging for survival and uncovering hidden secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u201cYou are not the first to be sent and may not be the last.\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/9724d7ee20d7d27634d216a1e5a02d6c.avif?t=1752693812\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>I WANT YOU TO JOIN THIS EXPEDITION!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Descend</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find out what's on the bottom of this abyss, descending through layers as deep as your courage will allow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/f4f7a3212948d164e42fa8941822f264.poster.avif?t=1752693812\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/f4f7a3212948d164e42fa8941822f264.webm?t=1752693812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/f4f7a3212948d164e42fa8941822f264.mp4?t=1752693812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Survive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don't be fooled by how everything looks; it has survived this long for a reason, and it's waiting for you to come down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/750ac2332df6dd9227da6ff4294dc100.poster.avif?t=1752693812\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/750ac2332df6dd9227da6ff4294dc100.webm?t=1752693812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/750ac2332df6dd9227da6ff4294dc100.mp4?t=1752693812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Remember to explore, learn everything you can to help future Pioneers with the knowledge to conquer the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/fa2bdd62d2f0859c041f57929215d244.poster.avif?t=1752693812\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/fa2bdd62d2f0859c041f57929215d244.webm?t=1752693812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/fa2bdd62d2f0859c041f57929215d244.mp4?t=1752693812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Scavenge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use everything you can find to your disposal, and remember to secure the classified documents to be sent back to base \u2013 the fate of the mission depends on it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/ed88294044ae53923cb49486ae488fda.poster.avif?t=1752693812\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/ed88294044ae53923cb49486ae488fda.webm?t=17